1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,820
Har bir katta tarixning boshlanishida…

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,972
hali bo‘sh joylar bo‘ladi.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,528
Ammo bu stadionda siz uchun ham joy bor.

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,760
ZAMIN FK’ni biz birgalikda quramiz.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:19,409
Har bir muxlis — bu stadiondagi yana bir o‘rin.

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:25,917
500 ta muxlisga yetganimizda, sizlar uchun tayyorlayotgan yangi imkoniyatimizni ochib beramiz.

7
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,519
Va unutmang — ZAMIN FK’da o‘ynash mutlaqo bepul!

8
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,667
Bu stadionda sizning ham joyingiz bor.

9
00:00:33,707 --> 00:00:37,252
Bizni kuzating va do‘stlaringizni ham taklif qiling.

